                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "20096687",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198010484273",
                            "num_reviews": 3,
                            "playtime_forever": 24,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 17,
                            "last_played": 1472323220
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is unfinished, do not buy it. \n\nIt is both poorly optimized and poorly designed.  Other than using windows 7 my computer meets the recomended specs but I still get a cripplingly low framerate that makes this game hard to play and unpleasant to look at. Steam overlay doesn't work in game so I have to guess that I get around 15fps in game and 2fps on the ship select screen,\n\nThere is no tutorial or key to explain what the powerups do, or what you are supposed to shoot vs. what you need to dodge.\n\nThe shoot button on the controller is the same as the close message button so I am not sure if I killed the boss , he killed me, or the level ended because the song was over because I closed the message as soon as it popped up. When the next level started there was no music playing and everything was moving very slowly, the game does not autoplay the next track, I had to pause the game and select another song to play.\n\nI see that the developer has released a couple of updates this month so maybe the game will get better but in its current state (v1.02) I don't recomend getting it.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1451433515,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1451433515,
                        "voted_up": false,
                        "votes_up": 15,
                        "votes_funny": 1,
                        "weighted_vote_score": 0.665459930896759,
                        "comment_count": 0,
                        "steam_purchase": false,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": false,
                        "developer_response": "Hey, we actually really appreciate what you said in your review, and have just launched a new update that has addressed what you stated (optimization issues, lack of tutorialization or direction, issues with confirm and shoot button being the same) and other things beyond that. Apologies for the update taking a while; we've had to work on some other things alongside it. I hope you try the new update, and maybe your opinion may change. \n\nThanks again either way for the feedback.",
                        "timestamp_dev_responded": 1466704609,
                        "primarily_steam_deck": false,
                        "refunded": false
                    }
                ],
